   "source": [
    "The magnitude plots start off very similar, but you'll notice that the digital filter has a sudden downturn. This is because it approaches the Nyquist frequency! It's a consequence of the digitalisation of the analogue filter. If we plotted the Bode diagram of the equivalent LTI system, we'd get the exact same curves as the circuit simulation, which I think is pretty cool. I hope you think so too! \n",
    "\n",
    "Let's write the code that will finally let us hear the song."
